          "jcr:created": "Tue Apr 26 2022 14:51:45 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Support for Conducting Clinical Research: Investigator-Initiated Studies (IIS) Program at Stryker Medical</span></span></h1>\n<p>Physician and nurse investigators wishing to conduct research using our products can request support through our Investigator-Initiated Studies (IIS) Program. Click the following links for products within the Stryker <b><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/acute-care.html#products\">Acute Care</a></b>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/emergency-patient-transport.html\" target=\"_self\"><b>Emergency Care Transport</b></a>, and <b><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/sage.html#products\">Sage</a></b> product portfolios.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The IIS Program is open to qualified clinical investigators who are interested in independently planning, designing, sponsoring, executing, and publishing their own research. <b>Support may include funding and/or product support for original clinical research in mutually beneficial therapeutic areas.</b></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 19 2025 20:38:00 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "2",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 19 2025 20:38:45 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Current areas of interest include:</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 31 2025 19:49:53 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true",
          "bottomMargin": "-2"
        }
      }
    },
